# Simulated CT output — hundreds of MB and fully regenerable.
#   *.jls  acquisition caches from pcat_ct_sim.jl (~150 MB each, ~17 min to rebuild)
#   *.raw  reconstructed volumes and phantom rasters, re-exported by pcat_export_clinical.jl
# The small derived artefacts in pcat_ct/ (CSV tables, figures) ARE tracked — they are the
# results, and they cost nothing to carry.
pcat_ct/*.raw
